  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional TB in Mining Sector in Southern Africa - Africa - Multicountry Southern Africa TIMS (01-Jul-2021-30-Jun-2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Southern Africa TIMS, Tuberculosis, East, Central and Southern Africa Health Community (ECSA-HC)This program has the following goals: To contribute towards the reduction of the TB burden in the mining sector in Southern African countries. The objectives of this program are: To increase TB case finding among the key populations in the mining sector in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </description>
